#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:32 f0a85b39ebca4935b063195537cc3f49
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed taxonomic information for a specific plant "
"species from Plants of the World Online (POWO). Returns comprehensive "
"data including taxonomic classification, accepted name, synonyms, "
"geographic distribution by region, morphological descriptions, and "
"images. Use POWO\\_search\\_plants to find the fqId (fully qualified ID) "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:65
#: 573ed99524b24ef8954f84fa8929cf9e bbf62a248d2042b2ab06e4f6e269a266
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:36 8429c437e313418181238ff3eefd9c37
msgid ""
"``fqId`` (string) (required) Fully qualified taxon ID from POWO. Format: "
"'urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:XXXXXXX-X'. Example: "
"'urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:717960-1' (Rosa canina). Obtained from "
"POWO\\_search\\_plants results."
msgstr ""

