#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:61 5dbd1613e28d48bf850602eefea14e0c
msgid "**Name**: ``POWO_search_plants``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:63 9d258ca108b14ac894c2589d20bb038b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the Plants of the World Online (POWO) database "
"maintained by the Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew. POWO is the most "
"comprehensive global checklist of vascular plants with 1.3+ million names"
" and 350,000+ accepted species. Search by plant name, genus, family, or "
"common name. Returns taxonomic information including accepted names, "
"synonyms, distribution, and images. Essential for plant taxonomy, botany,"
" and biodiversity research."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:67 346676af473848759c808b787bf85ab7
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) Search query. Can be scientific name, common "
"name, genus, or family. Examples: 'rosa canina', 'orchid', 'Asteraceae', "
"'oak'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:70 3bd530bf534f4c08bbc6d3486b7423b8
msgid ""
"``f`` (string, null) (optional) Filter facets (comma-separated). Common "
"filters: 'species\\_f:true' (species only), 'accepted\\_names:true' (only"
" accepted names). Example: 'species\\_f:true'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:73 3b784feb730e4ccba2fce0b40157f881
msgid ""
"``perPage`` (integer, null) (optional) Results per page (default 24, max "
"500)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/powo_tools.rst:76 72ca7ef1d16c4a4baae9cc271e61cdd3
msgid ""
"``cursor`` (string, null) (optional) Pagination cursor from previous "
"response"
msgstr ""

